<a href="#tab-reviews" role="tab" aria-controls="tab-reviews">
Reviews (0)					</a></li></ul><div class="woocommerce-Tabs-panel woocommerce-Tabs-panel--description panel entry-content wc-tab" id="tab-description" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-title-description"><h2>Description</h2><p data-start="0" data-end="47"><span style="color: #339966;">The Hulled Flaxseed manufacturer is located in Inner Mongolia, China. Flaxseeds are locally selected fine seeds.</span></p><h2 data-start="0" data-end="47"><strong data-start="4" data-end="45">Product Description: Hulled Flaxseed</strong></h2><h3 data-start="49" data-end="76"><strong data-start="54" data-end="74">Product Overview</strong></h3><p data-start="77" data-end="381">Hulled Flaxseed is derived from flaxseeds through a meticulous dehulling process that removes the outer shell while preserving the nutrient-rich core. Compared to whole flaxseeds, flaxseed kernels are easier to digest and process, making them ideal for direct consumption and industrial applications.</p><h3 data-start="383" data-end="411"><strong data-start="388" data-end="409">Dehulling Process</strong></h3><p data-start="412" data-end="508">Our Hulled Flaxseed is produced using advanced physical dehulling techniques, which include:</p><ol data-start="509" data-end="1012"><li data-start="509" data-end="617"><strong data-start="512" data-end="536">Cleaning &amp; Screening</strong> – Removing impurities through air separation, sieving, and gravity separation.</li><li data-start="618" data-end="744"><strong data-start="621" data-end="650">Low-Temperature Dehulling</strong> – Utilizing mechanical dehulling under controlled temperatures to retain maximum nutrients.</li><li data-start="745" data-end="876"><strong data-start="748" data-end="772">Separation &amp; Sorting</strong> – Using airflow separation and fine screening to ensure complete removal of hulls and improve purity.</li><li data-start="877" data-end="1012"><strong data-start="880" data-end="910">Color Sorting &amp; Inspection</strong> – Advanced color sorting machines remove discolored or broken kernels, ensuring consistent quality.</li></ol><h2 data-start="1014" data-end="1059"><strong data-start="1019" data-end="1057">Nutritional Information (Per 100g)</strong></h2><table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="2"><tbody><tr><td width="257">Nutrient</td><td width="170">Amount</td></tr><tr><td width="257">Energy</td><td width="170">534 kcal</td></tr><tr><td width="257">Protein</td><td width="170">18.3 g</td></tr><tr><td width="257">Fat</td><td width="170">42.2 g</td></tr><tr><td width="257">&#8211; Including α-Linolenic Acid (Omega-3)</td><td width="170">22.8 g</td></tr><tr><td width="257">Carbohydrates</td><td width="170">28.9 g</td></tr><tr><td width="257">Dietary Fiber</td><td width="170">27.3 g</td></tr><tr><td width="257">Vitamin B1 (Thiamine)</td><td width="170">1.6 mg</td></tr><tr><td width="257">Vitamin B6</td><td width="170">0.47 mg</td></tr><tr><td width="257">Folate</td><td width="170">87 μg</td></tr><tr><td width="257">Magnesium</td><td width="170">392 mg</td></tr><tr><td width="257">Calcium</td><td width="170">255 mg</td></tr><tr><td width="257">Potassium</td><td width="170">813 mg</td></tr><tr><td width="257">Iron</td><td width="170">5.7 mg</td></tr><tr><td width="257">Zinc</td><td width="170">4.3 mg</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 data-start="1448" data-end="1510"><strong data-start="1453" data-end="1508">Applications &amp; Benefits Compared to Whole Flaxseeds</strong></h2><p data-start="1512" data-end="1661">Flaxseed kernels are widely used in food, nutraceutical, and pet food industries. Compared to whole flaxseeds, they offer the following advantages:</p><table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="2" data-start="1663" data-end="2564"><thead data-start="1663" data-end="1730"><tr data-start="1663" data-end="1730"><th data-start="1663" data-end="1677">Application</th><th data-start="1677" data-end="1695">Whole Flaxseeds</th><th data-start="1695" data-end="1714">Flaxseed Kernels</th><th data-start="1714" data-end="1730">Key Benefits</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="1761" data-end="2564"><tr data-start="1761" data-end="1955"><td><strong data-start="1763" data-end="1797">Baking (Bread, Cakes, Cookies)</strong></td><td>Require grinding or pre-treatment for better texture</td><td>Can be added directly for enhanced texture and nutrition</td><td>Better flavor, reduced processing steps</td></tr><tr data-start="1956" data-end="2110"><td><strong data-start="1958" data-end="2001">Beverages (Smoothies, Plant-based Milk)</strong></td><td>Need soaking and straining</td><td>Mixes easily and dissolves better</td><td>Smoother texture, no need for filtering</td></tr><tr data-start="2111" data-end="2261"><td><strong data-start="2113" data-end="2154">Dietary Supplements (Oatmeal, Salads)</strong></td><td>Hard shells may affect digestion and texture</td><td>Ready to eat and easier to digest</td><td>Improved absorption</td></tr><tr data-start="2262" data-end="2430"><td><strong data-start="2264" data-end="2312">Functional Foods (Protein Bars, Energy Bars)</strong></td><td>Affects texture and consistency</td><td>Blends seamlessly with other ingredients</td><td>Ideal for premium nutrition products</td></tr><tr data-start="2431" data-end="2564"><td><strong data-start="2433" data-end="2445">Pet Food</strong></td><td>Requires crushing for digestibility</td><td>Easily mixed for improved Omega-3 intake</td><td>Supports pet coat and skin health</td></tr></tbody></table><h4 data-start="2566" data-end="2606"><strong data-start="2571" data-end="2604">Packaging &amp; OEM Customization</strong></h4><ul data-start="2607" data-end="2949"><li data-start="2607" data-end="2709"><strong data-start="2609" data-end="2631">Standard Packaging</strong>: 25kg bags (food-grade kraft paper bags/PP woven bags with PE inner lining)</li><li data-start="2710" data-end="2806"><strong data-start="2712" data-end="2738">Custom Small Packaging</strong>: Available in 250g, 500g, 1kg, and other sizes for retail markets</li><li data-start="2807" data-end="2949"><strong data-start="2809" data-end="2827">OEM/ODM Orders</strong>: We offer private labeling, customized specifications, and tailored blends. Global partners are welcome to collaborate!</li></ul><h2 data-start="2951" data-end="2994"><strong data-start="2956" data-end="2992">FAQ (Frequently Asked Questions)</strong></h2><p data-start="2996" data-end="3203"><strong data-start="2996" data-end="3041">1. How should flaxseed kernels be stored?</strong><br data-start="3041" data-end="3044" />Flaxseed kernels should be stored in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight. For long-term freshness, refrigeration is recommended to prevent oxidation.</p><p data-start="3205" data-end="3464"><strong data-start="3205" data-end="3281">2. Do flaxseed kernels have the same health benefits as whole flaxseeds?</strong><br data-start="3281" data-end="3284" />Yes! Flaxseed kernels retain the same essential nutrients, including Omega-3 fatty acids, protein, and fiber, but are easier to digest due to the removal of the hard outer shell.</p><p data-start="3466" data-end="3699"><strong data-start="3466" data-end="3510">3. Can flaxseed kernels be consumed raw?</strong><br data-start="3510" data-end="3513" />Yes, flaxseed kernels can be eaten raw or added to various foods like yogurt, smoothies, and baked goods. Unlike whole flaxseeds, they do not need to be ground for nutrient absorption.</p><p data-start="3701" data-end="3884"><strong data-start="3701" data-end="3760">4. Are flaxseed kernels suitable for gluten-free diets?</strong><br data-start="3760" data-end="3763" />Yes, flaxseed kernels are naturally gluten-free and an excellent source of plant-based nutrients for gluten-free diets.</p><p data-start="3886" data-end="4087"><strong data-start="3886" data-end="3939">5. Do you offer private labeling and bulk orders?</strong><br data-start="3939" data-end="3942" />Yes, we provide OEM and ODM services, including private labeling, bulk packaging, and customized formulations to meet different business needs.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></div><div class="woocommerce-Tabs-panel woocommerce-Tabs-panel--reviews panel entry-content wc-tab" id="tab-reviews" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-title-reviews"><div id="reviews" class="woocommerce-Reviews"><div id="comments"><h2 class="woocommerce-Reviews-title">
